<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES EDGE HIGHER.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES EDGE HIGHER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor market interest rates</p>
<p>edged higher at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate rose two basis point to 3.40 pct.</p>
<p>				   August 26 fix	 August 23 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		    3.29 pct		3.27 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		    3.34 pct		3.32 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		    3.40 pct		3.38 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		    3.55 pct		3.52 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		    3.70 pct		3.68 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		   3.87 pct		3.85 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 248</p>
</text>
